OL,3,ATrump ousts Kimberly Guilfoyle as US
OL,4,Aambassador to Greece after corruption
OL,5,Aallegations
OL,6,
OL,7,FPresident Donald Trump's administration
OL,8,Fhas asked Kimberly Guilfoyle to resign
OL,9,Ffrom her position as US ambassador to
OL,10,FGreece, according to new White House
OL,11,FPress Secretary Katie Zacharia.
OL,13,FGuilfoyle, a former Fox News host, was
OL,14,Ffacing mounting scrutiny over
OL,15,Fallegations she asked a Trump donor to
OL,16,Fpay her hefty credit card bill in
OL,17,Fexchange for access to the
OL,18,Fadministration and behaved
OL,19,Finappropriately while in Athens.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
